<title>USA: Bell Atlantic, NYNEX postpone briefing.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic, NYNEX postpone briefing.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Atlantic Corp and NYNEX Corp said they postponed a media briefing on their strategy to alleviate Internet congestion due to take place at the National Press Club Washington at 1300 EST/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>A spokesman said they needed to finalize a few more details. No new data was given.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsrom 212 859 1610))</p>
